  "finding": "The rendered CSS font-family stacks differ: Fluent specifies the Segoe UI/Web stack with system fallbacks; Bluent computes Tahoma. Both use 14px, weight 600, line-height 20px, 12px inline padding and centered text. Range text width is 57.72px for Fluent and 70px for Bluent, a 12.28px delta within equal 96px host boxes. This is a confirmed computed-style/geometry difference in this browser, not automatic proof of a design defect. The approved Bluent design and owner #428 must determine the intended font mapping.",
